#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Add a stats bar to your installed T3 Code Nightly (macOS or Linux).

Run it after every T3 Code update. Everything happens on this machine: the
patches in this repo are applied to the exact upstream commit your AppImage was
built from, the web, server and desktop bundles are rebuilt, and the result is
laid over your app on macOS (with a full stock backup), or a copy on Linux.
T3 user data is never modified by the installer.
"""
